+the obstruction class of a particular lift.
+\end{statement}
+\begin{proof}
+We construct the free Lie bracket matrices over $\F_p$,
+take the kernel from B.10, and construct the transposition
+$S$ and cycle $R$ by substitution in Lyndon brackets.
+The code checks $S^2=R^3=1$ and $SRS=R^{-1}$ on each
+module. For a normalized cochain $c$ the differential is
+\[
+ (dc)(g_1,\ldots,g_{j+1})=
+ g_1c(g_2,\ldots,g_{j+1})
+ +\sum_{i=1}^j(-1)^i
+  c(g_1,\ldots,g_i g_{i+1},\ldots,g_{j+1})
+ +(-1)^{j+1}c(g_1,\ldots,g_j).
+\]
+Cochains with an identity argument are zero. We construct
+the full matrices $d^0,d^1,d^2$, of target dimensions
+$5\dim M_n$, $25\dim M_n$, and $125\dim M_n$.
