+\begin{statement}{B.14}{Open}{The exceptional-prime integral lifting problem}
+The table in B.13 does not decide whether the specified
+$q_7$, $2q_7$, or $3q_7$ lifts to an $S_3$-centralizing
+automorphism of the free pro-$2$ or pro-$3$ group.
