+parameter must be carried along. The construction
+by word substitution therefore gives a discrete-point
+action only and does not determine the requested functor.
+The first remaining test is that dual-number functor,
+followed by compatibility with the finite quotient's
+nonsemisimple action in characteristic two. The complete
+finite-cover module and Schreier words are supplied by
+B.23; what remains missing is the scheme action.
